                                                "sense_id": "5df0bd67-a6e9-3f55-897b-fe5137925878",
                                                "text": "His voice full of remonstration, he repeated continually: \"Time's up, gentlemen. Go on now and get your lunch. Lunch time now. Go on now, or I'll have to report you. Time's up.\""
